  "id": "double-bind",
  "term": "double bind",
  "definition": "A double bind is a social situation in which a person is pressured to meet two conflicting expectations at the same time. In the example described here, women in male-dominated settings are expected to show traditionally masculine qualities while also maintaining feminine ones.",
